.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-s3-website-set - Enable / update the static website


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro s3 website set   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Enable / update the static website

.PP
Full replace: omitted fields fall back to the defaults (index.html, no error page, SPA off). \fBindex_document\fR is a file name (no \fB/\fR), served at the root and in every folder. \fBspa: true\fR answers every missing path with the entry file and status 200 (React/Vue/Angular routing, page reloads); real files are served as they are and the error page is not used while SPA is on. Enabling a disabled website needs \fBaccept: true\fR (abuse rules: everything in the bucket becomes public). Address: \fBhttps://<bucket>-<service code>.web.gyro-s3.com\fR and connected custom domains.

.PP
API: PUT /cloud/storage/{id}/buckets/{bucket}/website (operationId typed_put_storage\fBid\fPbuckets\fBbucket\fPwebsite, scope services_write)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--accept\fP[=false]
	Accept the abuse rules (needed when the website is off)

.PP
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB--error-document\fP=""
	Object key of the 404 page (e.g. 404.html or errors/404.html), empty = none

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for set

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	idempotency key (automatic for money operations)

.PP
\fB--index-document\fP=""
	Entry file name, default index.html (e.g. app.html)

.PP
\fB--set\fP=[]
	extra body field key=value (repeatable)

.PP
\fB--spa\fP[=false]
	Route missing sub-paths to the entry file with status 200


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	log HTTP requests to stderr (secrets masked)

.PP
\fB--lang\fP=""
	message language: tr or en (default from locale)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	disable colours (also NO_COLOR)

.PP
\fB--no-header\fP[=false]
	omit the table header

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	output format: table, json, yaml, text

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--profile\fP=""
	profile to use (env GYRO_PROFILE)

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath query applied to the result

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	print only ids

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=0s
	overall timeout, e.g. 30s, 10m

.PP
\fB--wide\fP[=false]
	show all table columns

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	do not ask for confirmation


